{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013420/extras/25d170c49eebd67b85273445b60a98f0.avif?t=1757929650\" width=905 height=110 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For hundreds of years, circles of druids have been tasked with leading the spirits of the dead to the spiritual world.    <br>Suddenly, 40 days after the death of a powerful druid, Elara, a mysterious beast of roots and dirt appeared. The beast seemingly aimed to destroy the forest and its inhabitants.   <br>Elara's husband, another powerful druid, Arik, is the only one who can, together with the forest creatures, stop the beast and put all souls to rest.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Move by using animal abilities inside your amulet \u2013 the frog, the raven and the fox</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013420/extras/23f9b5aff8f15567620f4ffc1cc4af58.poster.avif?t=1757929650\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013420/extras/23f9b5aff8f15567620f4ffc1cc4af58.webm?t=1757929650\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013420/extras/23f9b5aff8f15567620f4ffc1cc4af58.mp4?t=1757929650\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet different animals and their ruined lands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013420/extras/96fd1bb228b14bbf1e3f6de87315dfac.poster.avif?t=1757929650\" width=1170 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3013420/extras/96fd1bb228b14bbf1e3f6de